    "The first foundational pillar of exceptional corporate culture is Non-Negotiable High Standards. As Amazon founder Jeff Bezos noted in his legendary shareholder letters: High standards are contagious. When a newly hired employee enters an organization where mediocrity is tolerated, their baseline performance quickly degrades to match the sluggish norm.",
